  <AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.22.options.0.label>어디선가 들어본 것 같다.</AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.22.options.0.label>
  <AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.22.options.1.label>계속 듣는다.</AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.22.options.1.label>
  <AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.23.options.0.label>계속 듣는다.</AL_DialogueDef_Lumiour.lines.23.options.0.label>
